{
  "id": 948541,
  "name": "Detail Deamon for Flux and SD 3.5 Turbo",
  "description": "<p>A port of muerrilla's sd-webui-Detail-Daemon as a node for ComfyUI, to adjust sigmas that generally enhance details, and possibly remove unwanted bokeh or background blurring, particularly with Flux models (but also works with SDXL, SD1.5, and likely other models). If the values are taken too far it results in an oversharpened and/or HDR effect. There are four nodes here. Multiply Sigmas and Lying Sigma Sampler are also included as alternative methods of generally enhancing details.</p><p></p><h2 id=\"install-1uqnmyvvw\">Install</h2><p>Locate your <strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes</span></strong></p><p>Open command prompt or Powershell ad type: git clone <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://github.com/Jonseed/ComfyUI-Detail-Daemon\">https://github.com/Jonseed/ComfyUI-Detail-Daemon</a></p><p>Type: <strong><span style=\"color:#ffffff\">cd ComfyUI-Detail-Daemon</span></strong></p><p>Type: <strong><span style=\"color:#fafafa\">pip install -r requirements.txt</span></strong></p><p></p><p>Download the workflows - have fun!</p><p></p>",
